I wrote the post-draft plan with `status: ready` and 6 queries, each tied to one of the three gaps in `draft_reference_gaps`. I didn't run any retrieval. I read the gap memo and JSON, the global memory summary and the existing bibliography. The JSON keeps the schema of `reference_query_plan.json`, including the central topic and the forbidden query patterns.

